L000261	To study the MO equation,
L000262	we will find it convenient to switch from $x$ to the time of flight variable $\tau$ of the classical trajectory at energy $\mu_F$:
L000263	\begin{equation}\label{eq:time-of-flight}
L000264	    \tau = \frac{1}{\pi} \int^x\limits \frac{\d y }{\rho(y)}\ .
L000265	\end{equation}
