L000268	The potential $\eta(g,\tau)$ at the critical and near critical point for quartic and cubic theories is shown in figure \ref{fig:MO-potential}.
L000269	
L000270	In order to focus on the Regge states of quartic theory \eqref{eq:regge-phi4}, let us study the MO equation at $g=g_c$. The change of variables is $x= \frac{1}{2\sqrt{|g_c|}} \tanh\frac{\tau}{\sqrt{2}}$,
L000271	and
L000272	$\tau\in (-\infty,\infty)$.
